; The lab zone. www holds two A records, the RRset the subscriber must
; resolve through Ze's resolver.
$ORIGIN lab.example.
$TTL 300
@       SOA   ns.lab.example. hostmaster.lab.example. 1 3600 600 86400 60
@       NS    ns
ns      A     172.29.0.7
www     A     192.0.2.10
www     A     192.0.2.11
